Kyarlotec is an [[Bestiary/Spark of Humanity#Umbryl|Umbryl]] with light gray skin covered in red tattoos. His eyes are mirrored such that one cannot tell where he is looking.

While Kyarlotec is currently an administrator for [[Org/Althane/Red Dragon Rail Company|RDRco]], he is also a vampire thrall and used to be part of the Salubra Cabal. He is estranged, however, and does not appear to be maintaining ties with anyone within the cabal.
